      "created_at": "2018-05-13T22:36:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hey all was thinking about this today while playing with setting sun ra. He removes cards from game. The issue I see is an Oblivaeon game. Let’s say setting Ra is Incapped and then the player decides to bring ra back using a different variant. Are those cards removed still removed from the game or will a new variant be treated as a completely new deck and all cards will be back.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>My thoughts is new deck and all cards are back but it is an interesting rule question when you can bring decks back from the dead by just changing the variant.</p>",
